超高清。\n\n拼图展示了同一只动物/宠物（来自用户上传的照片）的16 种不同情绪或生活态度，保持该动物的原始外观特征，仅设计表情、姿态、情绪和配饰。每一格的情绪表达要夸张而生动，有明显反差感，富有网感。\n\n将当前流行的网络热梗/表情包文化融入设计，文字使用美观且易读的综艺感表情包字体，注意不要生成错字和乱码，文字不要崩坏，不要使用带有具体性别指向的称呼和文案（比如哥、姐等等），可以适当添加贴纸、小元素作为装饰，保持画面干净不拥挤。\n\n每一格的背景、色调、光影可以根据该格的情绪自由发挥，但整体要形成一套完整的系列，不能杂乱无章。\n\n最终输出效果追求：高级质感、魔性、有爱、有创意、幽默风趣、极易传播，适合用作微信表情包。不要生成序号。请直接用 4×4 网格输出结果。便于后续我一键裁剪成 16 张独立的方形表情包。\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 17, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "image_url", "links": [], "label": "image_url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_url"}, {"name": "response", "links": [], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [400, 888], "pos": [900, 880], "widgets_values": ["", "1:1", "4k", "", "gpt-image-2", 1, "high", "auto", "png", 100, "auto", "url", true, "", 300, 5, 5, 900, 416858780878406, "randomize", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7",